meta {
  name: Rename Radiology Test List
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-test-lists/{{branchRadiologyTestListId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "B2B Corporate (2026)"
  }
}

docs {
  🔒 **RBAC:** requires `branch_admin:lab_test_list__rename_list` — enforced by
  `PermissionGuard`; admins bypass, so `{{businessAccessToken}}` succeeds.

  Rename a branch Radiology Test List. Business JWT. `name` (**required**, ≤120) is
  unique per branch among active lists (409
  `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_LIST_NAME_CONFLICT` on clash). 404
  `BRANCH_RADIOLOGY_TEST_LIST_NOT_FOUND` if the id isn't a live list in the active
  branch.
}
